{{fbdoc item="title" value="__FB_DRAGONFLY__"}}----

{{fbdoc item="syntax"}}
	""__FB_DRAGONFLY__""

{{fbdoc item="desc"}}
	Define without a value created at compile time when the DragonFly BSD
	target is being used.  It can be used to compile parts of a program only
	for DragonFly BSD.

{{fbdoc item="ex"}}
%%(freebasic)
#IFDEF __FB_DRAGONFLY__
	print "DragonFly BSD target"
#ENDIF
%%

{{fbdoc item="back" value="CatPgDddefines|Predefined Defines"}}
{{fbdoc item="see"}}
	[[CompilerOpttarget|Compiler Option: -target]]
----
